    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks Merlin is an adventure horror game where the main goal is to survive.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/5112ef888dc564079a947b3688fd9fd1.poster.avif?t=1752534471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/5112ef888dc564079a947b3688fd9fd1.webm?t=1752534471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br>You find yourself in a closed toy store under the control of a giant toy - Chummy Tummy. With a flashlight and a laser gun, you must find a way out of the maze of horror by solving puzzles created by the inventor Merlin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/88d471a1ef8110844311b2d9bbeba7d9.poster.avif?t=1752534471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/88d471a1ef8110844311b2d9bbeba7d9.webm?t=1752534471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merlin's World - a world of childhood and fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible adventure awaits you in the toy store. It used to be a place of cheerful atmosphere. But after a terrible incident, the shopping complex was closed. Discover the mystery of the mysterious Merlin and escape from the clutches of the cute but dreadful Chummy Tummy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/a7ee15db0b4807a53c1201a5b42a9b99.poster.avif?t=1752534471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/a7ee15db0b4807a53c1201a5b42a9b99.webm?t=1752534471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chummy Tummy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main hit of Merlin's store was his famous toy, Chummy Tummy. This cute creature won the hearts of all the kids and their parents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toys and More</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience the amazing use of Merlin's famous laser gun and lizard flashlight. These indispensable companions will help you overcome obstacles that you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser Gun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the laser gun to open doors and locks by shooting at the laser detectors installed throughout the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/075576aeed6c4892d8796526668ba859.poster.avif?t=1752534471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/075576aeed6c4892d8796526668ba859.webm?t=1752534471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lizard Flashlight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lizard flashlight will help you reveal children's drawings on the walls. Discover the fate of the children by revealing the drawings and putting the puzzles together.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks Merlin is an adventure horror game where the main goal is to survive.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/5112ef888dc564079a947b3688fd9fd1.poster.avif?t=1752534471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/5112ef888dc564079a947b3688fd9fd1.webm?t=1752534471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br>You find yourself in a closed toy store under the control of a giant toy - Chummy Tummy. With a flashlight and a laser gun, you must find a way out of the maze of horror by solving puzzles created by the inventor Merlin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/88d471a1ef8110844311b2d9bbeba7d9.poster.avif?t=1752534471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/88d471a1ef8110844311b2d9bbeba7d9.webm?t=1752534471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merlin's World - a world of childhood and fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible adventure awaits you in the toy store. It used to be a place of cheerful atmosphere. But after a terrible incident, the shopping complex was closed. Discover the mystery of the mysterious Merlin and escape from the clutches of the cute but dreadful Chummy Tummy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/a7ee15db0b4807a53c1201a5b42a9b99.poster.avif?t=1752534471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/a7ee15db0b4807a53c1201a5b42a9b99.webm?t=1752534471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chummy Tummy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main hit of Merlin's store was his famous toy, Chummy Tummy. This cute creature won the hearts of all the kids and their parents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toys and More</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience the amazing use of Merlin's famous laser gun and lizard flashlight. These indispensable companions will help you overcome obstacles that you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser Gun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the laser gun to open doors and locks by shooting at the laser detectors installed throughout the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/075576aeed6c4892d8796526668ba859.poster.avif?t=1752534471\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766270/extras/075576aeed6c4892d8796526668ba859.webm?t=1752534471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lizard Flashlight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lizard flashlight will help you reveal children's drawings on the walls. Discover the fate of the children by revealing the drawings and putting the puzzles together.</p>",
